{"id":"n15632-2-10","stage":3,"title":"수명 · 寿命","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15632-2-10-1","ko":"어, 어제 시계를 맞춰 놓았는데 또 시간이 느려졌어.","zh":"哎，我昨天才调过表的，怎么时间又慢了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어,","meaning":"咦","explanation":"어：咦。","readings":[{"term":"어","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26153","senseId":"1","lemma":"어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"시계를","meaning":"钟，表","explanation":"시계：钟，表；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시계","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30190","senseId":"1","lemma":"시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시계를","audio":"/audio/46973a68dd67a6235473.mp3"}},{"text":"맞춰","meaning":"调，调节","explanation":"맞추다：调，调节；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"맞추다","audio":"/audio/007d45bc6c182fe5443f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74127","senseId":"5","lemma":"맞추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞춰","audio":"/audio/c9803242a59a4fbefcde.mp3"}},{"text":"놓았는데","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓았는데","audio":"/audio/b929143d051e59d29833.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又。","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"시간이","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"2","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"느려졌어.","meaning":"慢，缓慢，迟缓；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"느리다：慢，缓慢，迟缓；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"느리다","audio":"/audio/fefab822c00f5a651f89.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23143","senseId":"1","lemma":"느리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"느려졌어","audio":"/audio/cc8c653b2d1154f35899.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"228794e2524374dc","term":"어","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/228794e2524374dc8637.mp3","entryId":"26153","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"a658dc1b94077c9f","term":"시계","zh":"钟，表","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3","entryId":"30190","definition":"指示时间的仪器。","pronunciation":["시계","시게"]},{"id":"007d45bc6c182fe5","term":"맞추다","zh":"调，调节","audio":"/audio/007d45bc6c182fe5443f.mp3","entryId":"74127","definition":"按照某个标准进行调整。","pronunciation":["맏추다"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"为了做某事而定下的时刻；或指一天中的某个时刻。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"fefab822c00f5a65","term":"느리다","zh":"慢，缓慢，迟缓","audio":"/audio/fefab822c00f5a651f89.mp3","entryId":"23143","definition":"做某个行为所用的时间长。","pronunciation":["느리다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cbed74f06fb893f2aa22.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15632-2-10-2","ko":"건전지가 수명이 다했나 보다.","zh":"看来是电池寿命到了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"건전지가","meaning":"电池，干电池","explanation":"건전지：电池，干电池；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"건전지","audio":"/audio/967a9f846b4fbbf22bac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25215","senseId":"1","lemma":"건전지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건전지가","audio":"/audio/57738c268bb7f7f924e4.mp3"}},{"text":"수명이","meaning":"寿命，使用期","explanation":"수명：寿命，使用期；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수명","audio":"/audio/2d664734d1fd447b8777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15632","senseId":"2","lemma":"수명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수명이","audio":"/audio/b12513862d8e4e9ec8fd.mp3"}},{"text":"다했나","meaning":"用尽，竭尽","explanation":"다하다：用尽，竭尽；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"다하다","audio":"/audio/238dc042d00a64bf08fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61526","senseId":"1","lemma":"다하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다했나","audio":"/audio/fe25d376b4f62b1a50cf.mp3"}},{"text":"보다.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}}],"words":[{"